Google Gemma 4 canonical chat template
---------------------------------------
Project path:
  configs/gemma4_chat_template.jinja

Upstream:
  google/gemma-4-E4B-it
  https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E4B-it

License:
  Apache License 2.0
  https://ai.google.dev/gemma/apache_2

